  "releaseNotes": "5.0.0 - Answer-key template and consumer scan API.\n- GenerateAnswerKeyTemplate / GenerateAnswerKeyTemplateAsync for blank teacher key sheets (reserved PaperId).\n- ScanAnswerKeyTemplate returns TemplateScanResult with effective MC/TF counts and gap-filled answer lists.\n- IOmrKit: ScanAnswerSheets (multi-image and multi-page PDF batch) and ScanAnswerKeyTemplate.\n- Breaking: removed IAnswerSheetGenerator.GenerateSheet(TestSheetSpec); use AnswerSheetSpec or TestSheetSpec.ToAnswerSheetSpec().\n- Requires OMRKIT2 LicenseKey. QuestPDF Community license is set by the library; verify QuestPDF terms for your deployment scale.\n- Ships OpenCvSharp Windows and linux-x64.slim native runtimes (see README). See CHANGELOG.md for full history.",
